          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="feature-tile">
          <div class="feature-icon-box bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning">
            <i class="bi bi-shield-shaded"></i>
          </div>
          <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Mixed-Cohort Collaboration</h5>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
            Teams combining Internal and External students must formally agree to the collaborative declaration before team creation is authorized by the system.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="feature-tile">
          <div class="feature-icon-box bg-info bg-opacity-10 text-info">
            <i class="bi bi-robot"></i>
          </div>
          <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2">AI Advisory Quality Auditing</h5>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
            Every submitted deliverable automatically triggers an AI inspection report displaying task alignment scores, code syntax integrity, and advisory warnings for faculty review.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="feature-tile">
          <div class="feature-icon-box bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success">
            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i>
          </div>
          <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Faculty Guide Verification</h5>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
            Deliverables in review are strictly audited by faculty. Guides inspect version diffs, provide feedback remarks, and either mark COMPLETED or send back to IN_PROGRESS.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="feature-tile">
          <div class="feature-icon-box bg-purple bg-opacity-10 text-purple" style="color: #8b5cf6; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);">
            <i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i>
          </div>
          <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Version History Preservation</h5>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
            Never lose progress. Prior iterations, repository URLs, AI scores, and faculty rework remarks remain permanently preserved in an immutable version log.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="feature-tile">
          <div class="feature-icon-box bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger">
            <i class="bi bi-lock-fill"></i>
          </div>
          <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Single-Use OTP Security</h5>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
            Email verification, password recovery, and username updates require cryptographic 6-digit OTP codes enforced with purpose-specific validation and single-use safeguards.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

